flowchart TD
    start([Start: Product Design Quality])
    step1["The user requests a feature with an optional visual reference."]
    start --> step1
    step2["The AI inspects the component inventory and project design profile."]
    step1 --> step2
    step3["CocoRef compares the reference requirements with existing components."]
    step2 --> step3
    step4["The AI selects reusable components before proposing any new component."]
    step3 --> step4
    step5["Every missing component follows CocoRef consent, preview, revision, and approval."]
    step4 --> step5
    step6["The user defines or approves semantic colors, spacing, radius, typography, elevation, and icon rules."]
    step5 --> step6
    step7["The AI implements the interface using approved primitives and tokens."]
    step6 --> step7
    step8["CocoQA runs the product-design principle audit."]
    step7 --> step8
    step9["The rendered result is compared with approved CocoRef criteria when a reference exists."]
    step8 --> step9
    step10["Contrast, overflow, responsive, spacing, and consistency defects are recorded."]
    step9 --> step10
    step11["The AI fixes defects and reruns the required checks."]
    step10 --> step11
    step12["A human reviewer grants explicit final design QA approval."]
    step11 --> step12
    success([A supported AI can audit approved references, the existing component inventory, and project design tokens; reuse existing components first; produce a consistent customizable interface; and prove spacing, color, contrast, iconography, overfl])
    step12 --> success
    error1["INVALID_DESIGN_PROFILE: report the invalid token fields and require a schema-valid profile."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error1
    error2["UNRESOLVED_TOKEN_REFERENCE: report a missing alias or cycle and require explicit token repair."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error2
    error3["COMPONENT_REUSE_NOT_AUDITED: refuse a new component proposal until inventory inspection completes."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error3
    error4["CONTRAST_FAILED: identify the foreground and background pair, measured ratio, required target, and affected element."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error4
    error5["OVERFLOW_DETECTED: identify the viewport, element, clipping or horizontal overflow, and reproduction evidence."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error5
    error6["INCONSISTENT_SPACING: identify values outside the approved scale and their locations."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error6
    error7["INCONSISTENT_ICONOGRAPHY: identify inconsistent family, size, stroke, alignment, or accessible labeling."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error7
    error8["REFERENCE_UNAVAILABLE: preserve lifecycle state and ask for a valid completed CocoRef or reference."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error8
    error9["VISUAL_FIDELITY_FAILED: report the approved criterion and deviation that exceeded its tolerance."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error9
    error10["EVIDENCE_UNAVAILABLE: keep the relevant gate blocked and provide a safe retry path."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error10
    error11["SENSITIVE_VISUAL_EVIDENCE_BLOCKED: refuse persistence until sensitive regions are removed or redacted."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error11
    error12["DESIGN_STATE_CONFLICT: invalidate stale review after reference, token, or component source changes."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error12
    error13["COMPONENT_IMPACT_CONFLICT: report affected consumers and require a reviewed compatibility plan."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error13
    error14["DESIGN_GATE_TIMEOUT: abort safely, clean temporary evidence, and allow a bounded retry."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error14
    error15["Every diagnostic is stable and machine-readable, includes recovery guidance, and never changes approval state silently."]
    step12 -. failure .-> error15
